{"ticker":{"symbol":"004020.KS","name":"현대제철","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":28900.0,"change_pct":0.012259194395796813,"market_cap":3801671794688.0,"pe":11.4310665,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.01730103806228374,"week52_low":23650.0,"week52_high":50400.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","country":"South Korea","city":"Incheon","employees":null,"website":"https://www.hyundai-steel.com","business_summary":"Hyundai Steel Company, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacture and sale of steel and other industrial metal products in Korea, rest of Asia, the United States, and Europe. The company offers hot and cold rolled steel sheets, steel and heavy plates, ERW and steel pipes, reinforcing bars, special steel bars, heavy machinery, wire rods, and automotive parts, as well as tailor welded blanks, hydroforming, and hot stamping products; and H-sections, angles, I beams, steel sheet piles, and railway rails. It serves automobile, shipbuilding, and construction industries. The company was formerly known as INI Steel Company and changed its name to Hyundai Steel Company in March 2006. Hyundai Steel Company was founded in 1953 and is headquartered in Incheon, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"현대제철은 자회사들과 함께 한국, 기타 아시아 지역, 미국, 유럽에서 철강 및 기타 산업용 금속제품을 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 열간 및 냉간 압연 강판, 강철 및 후판, ERW 및 강관, 철근, 특수강 봉강, 중장비, 선재 및 자동차 부품뿐만 아니라 맞춤형 용접 블랭크, 하이드로포밍 및 핫 스탬핑 제품을 제공합니다. H형강, 앵글, I빔, 강판말뚝, 철도레일 등이 있습니다. 자동차, 조선, 건설 산업에 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 INI Steel Company로 알려졌으며 2006년 3월 현대제철로 이름을 변경했습니다. 현대제철은 1953년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 인천에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":24024666670000.0,"rev_lo":23719200000000.0,"rev_hi":24267800000000.0,"rev_g":0.3497,"n":12,"eps":878.875,"eps_lo":537.0,"eps_hi":1448.0,"eps_g":17.5825},{"period":"2027","rev":24974267240000.0,"rev_lo":23320375820000.0,"rev_hi":26846000000000.0,"rev_g":0.3176,"n":16,"eps":2528.198,"eps_lo":845.0,"eps_hi":4121.0,"eps_g":1.8766}],"ltg":null,"ca